          "Distinct from `kamitani_god` (`ds001246`, 3.0 mm, TR=3.0 s, 9 s blocks): `deep_image_recon` (`ds001506`) upgrades spatial/temporal acquisition to `2.0 mm` isotropic multiband-4 (`TR = 2.0 s`, `8 s` blocks) and adds explicit OOD geometric shape + letter + shape-imagery sessions.",
          "Stimulus images are restricted by ImageNet/copyright distribution terms on OpenNeuro; request/rebuild exact stimulus tensors via KamitaniLab's `StimulusPresentation` / `Figshare` scripts using WordNet synset + frame IDs."
