          "Z-PLANE REGISTRATION DRIFT & NUCLEAR-FILLED EXCLUSION ARTIFACTS: Apparent multi-week 'representational drift' can be severely inflated by subtle (`2–5 µm`) axial focal-plane tilt, GCaMP6s cytomorbid nuclear filling, or ROI segmentation mismatch—always verify stable structural morphology/correlation metrics and compare **within-neuron grating stability vs. natural-movie drift recorded in the EXACT same session** (`Marks & Goard 2021` internal control!).",
