        "standard_splits": "10-fold trial-stratified cross-validation fitting time-expanded ridge regression design matrices (`task` variables + `instructed` movements + `uninstructed` video/sensor movements) directly onto `200`-rank widefield SVD temporal components `V(t)`, comparing **full-model `cvR²`**, **single-variable marginal `cvR²`**, and **unique variance `ΔR² = R²_full − R²_{full \\ X}`**.",
        "noise_ceiling_or_repeat_structure": "Delayed 2AFC visual/auditory flash/click rate discrimination trials (`Stimulus -> 1.0 s Delay -> Go Cue -> Left/Right Spout Lick`) repeated hundreds of times per session across `10` genetically defined Cre driver lines (`Emx1`, `Cux2`, `Fezf2`, `PlxnD1`, `CSP`, `Pvalb`, `SST`, `VIP`, etc.).",
        "key_pitfalls": [
          "MARGINAL `cvR²` VS. UNIQUE `ΔR²` COLLINEARITY TRAP: Task events (stimulus onset, delay, reward) trigger stereotype-locked uninstructed movements (whisking, nose twitching, hindpaw bracing); fitting a task-only encoding model yields high `cvR²` that actually reflects movement! ALWAYS compute **unique variance (`ΔR²`)** by comparing the full joint model (`task + all movements`) against reduced models dropping each regressor group (`musall/ridgeModel`).",
          "HEMODYNAMIC CONTAMINATION IN WIDEFIELD `473 nm` FLUORESCENCE: Blood volume and oxygenation changes strongly absorb blue/green light across dorsal cortex—never model raw single-wavelength `dF/F` without regressing out the quasi-simultaneous `405 nm` violet isosbestic control channel!",
          "Work directly in the compressed `U (spatial) × V (temporal)` 200-component SVD basis (`V` has shape `200 × T`): ridge regression with L2 penalty commutes linearly with orthonormal spatial basis `U`, speeding up pixelwise cortex-wide fitting by `>1,000×` without approximation loss."
        ]
