          "CIRCULAR TOPOLOGY & LOSS WRAPPING: Head angle `θ ∈ [0, 2π)` is periodic (`0 ≡ 2π`)—NEVER regress raw scalar angles with Euclidean MSE (which introduces a `2π` cliff discontinuity!); always optimize `(cos θ, sin θ)` on the unit circle or von Mises / circular geodesic loss.",
